            "description": {
              "content": "Returns metadata for the attachment. Currently includes EXIF data for image and video formats that carry EXIF (JPEG, TIFF, WebP, HEIC/HEIF, PNG, QuickTime, MP4, AVI, M4V). The exif section is empty for supported formats that contain no EXIF data.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
